<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Abriendo el Foco — Testeha Estudio × Asociación Achalay</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Anton&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --black:#0a0b09;
    --black-soft:#131510;
    --black-card:#17190f;
    --white:#ffffff;
    --white-dim: rgba(255,255,255,0.68);
    --white-faint: rgba(255,255,255,0.42);
    --green:#019946;
    --green-deep:#03873d;
    --green-dark:#0b3d21;
    --line: rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
    --radius: 3px;
  }

  *{box-sizing:border-box; margin:0; padding:0;}
  html{ scroll-behavior:smooth; }

  body{
    background:var(--black);
    color:var(--white);
    font-family:'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size:16px;
    line-height:1.6;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  }

  ::selection{ background:var(--green); color:var(--black); }
  a{ color:inherit; text-decoration:none; }

  .wrap{ max-width:1160px; margin:0 auto; padding:0 32px; }

  .eyebrow{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:12.5px;
    letter-spacing:0.14em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color: var(--white-dim);
    display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;
  }
  .eyebrow::before{
    content:"";
    width:7px; height:7px; border-radius:50%;
    background:var(--green);
    display:inline-block; flex-shrink:0;
  }

  h1,h2,h3{
    font-family:'Anton', sans-serif;
    font-weight:400;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    letter-spacing:0.005em;
    line-height:0.98;
  }

  /* ---------- NAV ---------- */
  header.site{
    position:sticky; top:0; z-index:50;
    background:rgba(10,11,9,0.82);
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .navbar{
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between;
    padding:18px 32px;
    max-width:1160px; margin:0 auto;
  }
  .navbar .logo{
    font-family:'Anton', sans-serif;
    font-size:23px;
    letter-spacing:0.01em;
    display:flex; gap:7px;
  }
  .navbar .logo .foco{ color:var(--green); }
  .navbar nav{ display:flex; gap:44px; font-size:14px; color:var(--white-dim); }
  .navbar .studio-badge{
    display:flex; align-items:center; gap:9px;
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:12px; letter-spacing:0.04em;
    color: var(--white-dim);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    padding:9px 16px;
    border-radius:100px;
    white-space:nowrap;
  }
  .navbar .studio-badge::before{
    content:""; width:7px; height:7px; border-radius:50%;
    background:var(--green); flex-shrink:0;
  }
  .navbar .studio-badge:hover{ border-color:var(--white-faint); color:var(--white); }
  @media (max-width:760px){ .navbar nav{ display:none; } }

  /* ---------- HERO ---------- */
  .hero{
    position:relative;
    padding:110px 0 90px;
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .hero-glow{
    position:absolute; top:-20%; right:-10%;
    width:640px; height:640px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(1,153,70,0.35), transparent 70%);
    filter: blur(40px);
    pointer-events:none;
  }
  .hero-arcs{
    position:absolute; top:50%; right:2%; transform:translateY(-50%);
    width:640px; height:640px;
    opacity:0.5;
    pointer-events:none;
  }
  .hero-grid{
    position:relative;
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 0.95fr;
    gap:56px;
    align-items:center;
  }
  @media (max-width:900px){ .hero-grid{ grid-template-columns:1fr; } }

  .hero h1{
    font-size:clamp(46px, 6.4vw, 78px);
    margin:22px 0 24px;
  }
  .hero h1 .foco{ color:var(--green); }
  .hero p.lede{
    font-size:17.5px;
    color:var(--white-dim);
    max-width:46ch;
    margin-bottom:34px;
  }
  .hero-ctas{ display:flex; gap:16px; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:center; }
  .hero-trust-row{ display:flex; align-items:flex-start; gap:64px; margin-top:64px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
  .hero-trusted{ margin-top:0; }
  .hero-trusted .eyebrow{ margin-bottom:18px; }
  .hero-trusted img{ height:84px; width:auto; opacity:0.95; }

  .hero-thanks{ margin-top:0; }
  .hero-thanks .eyebrow{ margin-bottom:16px; }
  .hero-thanks-logos{ display:flex; align-items:center; gap:28px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
  .hero-thanks-logos img{ height:26px; width:auto; }
  .hero-thanks-logos .chip{
    background:var(--white);
    padding:10px 16px;
    border-radius:8px;
    display:flex; align-items:center;
  }
  .hero-thanks-logos .chip img{ height:24px; }
  .btn{
    display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;
    padding:14px 26px;
    font-size:14px; font-weight:500;
    border-radius:100px;
    transition: transform .2s ease, background .2s, color .2s, border-color .2s;
  }
  .btn-primary{ background:var(--green); color:var(--white); border:1px solid var(--green); }
  .btn-primary:hover{ background:var(--green-deep); transform:translateY(-1px); }
  .btn-ghost{ border:1px solid var(--white-faint); color:var(--white); }
  .btn-ghost:hover{ border-color:var(--white); }
  .text-link{ font-size:14px; color:var(--white-dim); border-bottom:1px solid var(--white-faint); padding-bottom:2px; }
  .text-link:hover{ color:var(--white); border-color:var(--white); }

  /* Phone mockup */
  .phone-stage{
    position:relative;
    display:flex; justify-content:center;
  }
  .phone{
    position:relative;
    width:290px;
    background:#101210;
    border:8px solid #1c1e19;
    border-radius:38px;
    box-shadow: 0 40px 80px rgba(0,0,0,0.55), 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
    overflow:hidden;
    z-index:2;
  }
  .phone-notch{
    position:absolute; top:0; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%);
    width:120px; height:22px;
    background:#1c1e19;
    border-radius:0 0 16px 16px;
    z-index:3;
  }
  .phone-screen{ padding:38px 18px 20px; }
  .phone-topbar{
    display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center;
    font-size:11px; color:var(--white-dim);
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    margin-bottom:22px;
  }
  .phone-art{
    width:100%; aspect-ratio:1/1;
    border-radius:10px; overflow:hidden;
    margin-bottom:18px;
    box-shadow:0 14px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
  }
  .phone-art img{ width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; display:block; }
  .phone-title{ font-family:'Inter',sans-serif; font-weight:600; font-size:15px; margin-bottom:4px; }
  .phone-sub{ font-size:12.5px; color:var(--white-dim); margin-bottom:18px; }
  .phone-progress{ height:3px; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.18); border-radius:2px; margin-bottom:6px; position:relative; }
  .phone-progress::before{ content:""; position:absolute; left:0; top:0; height:100%; width:38%; background:var(--green); border-radius:2px; }
  .phone-time{ display:flex; justify-content:space-between; font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size:10px; color:var(--white-faint); margin-bottom:20px; }
  .phone-controls{ display:flex; justify-content:center; align-items:center; gap:26px; }
  .phone-controls svg{ width:18px; height:18px; fill:var(--white); }
  .phone-controls .play{
    width:46px; height:46px; border-radius:50%;
    background:var(--white); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
  }
  .phone-controls .play svg{ fill:var(--black); width:16px; height:16px; }
  .phone-caption{
    text-align:center; margin-top:22px;
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:11.5px; letter-spacing:.08em; text-transform:uppercase;
    color: var(--white-faint);
  }

  /* ---------- SECTION SHARED ---------- */
  section{ padding:90px 0; border-top:1px solid var(--line); }
  .section-head{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.55fr 1fr;
    gap:40px;
    margin-bottom:52px;
  }
  @media (max-width:760px){ .section-head{ grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:16px; } }
  .section-head h2{ font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,40px); }
  .section-head .lede{ color:var(--white-dim); font-size:16.5px; max-width:54ch; }

  /* ---------- ABOUT / QUOTE ---------- */
  .about-grid{
    display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:0;
    border:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  @media (max-width:760px){ .about-grid{ grid-template-columns:1fr; } }
  .about-text{ padding:44px; }
  .about-text p{ color:var(--white-dim); font-size:16px; margin-bottom:16px; }
  .about-quote{
    background:var(--green);
    color:var(--white);
    padding:44px;
    display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:center;
    border-left:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  @media (max-width:760px){ .about-quote{ border-left:none; border-top:1px solid var(--line); } }
  .about-quote blockquote{
    font-family:'Anton', sans-serif;
    font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,30px);
    line-height:1.15;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    margin-bottom:18px;
  }
  .about-quote cite{ font-style:normal; font-size:13px; opacity:0.85; }

  /* ---------- EPISODES ---------- */
  .episode{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns: 96px 1fr auto;
    gap:26px; align-items:center;
    padding:28px 0;
    border-top:1px solid var(--line);
    transition:background .2s;
  }
  .episode:last-child{ border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); }
  .episode:hover{ background:var(--black-soft); }
  .episode-cover{ width:96px; height:96px; border-radius:var(--radius); overflow:hidden; background:var(--green); flex-shrink:0; }
  .episode-cover img{ width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; display:block; }
  .episode-num{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size:12px; color:var(--green);
    letter-spacing:.08em; text-transform:uppercase; margin-bottom:6px;
  }
  .episode-title{
    font-family:'Anton', sans-serif; text-transform:none; letter-spacing:0;
    font-size:20px; line-height:1.2; margin-bottom:8px; max-width:58ch;
  }
  .episode-guests{ font-size:13.5px; color:var(--white-dim); }
  .episode-meta{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size:12.5px; color:var(--white-dim);
    text-align:right; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:flex-end; gap:10px; white-space:nowrap;
  }
  .episode-meta .play{
    display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; color:var(--white);
    border:1px solid var(--white-faint); padding:7px 14px; border-radius:100px;
    font-family:'Inter',sans-serif; font-size:13px; transition:background .2s, border-color .2s;
  }
  .episode-meta .play:hover{ background:var(--green); border-color:var(--green); }
  @media (max-width:640px){
    .episode{ grid-template-columns: 64px 1fr; }
    .episode-cover{ width:64px; height:64px; }
    .episode-meta{ grid-column:1/-1; flex-direction:row; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-top:10px; }
  }
  .wave{ display:flex; align-items:flex-end; gap:2px; height:14px; opacity:0; transition:opacity .2s; }
  .episode:hover .wave{ opacity:1; }
  .wave span{ width:2px; background:var(--green); animation: bar 1.1s ease-in-out infinite; }
  .wave span:nth-child(1){height:40%; animation-delay:0s;}
  .wave span:nth-child(2){height:100%; animation-delay:.12s;}
  .wave span:nth-child(3){height:60%; animation-delay:.24s;}
  .wave span:nth-child(4){height:80%; animation-delay:.36s;}
  .wave span:nth-child(5){height:30%; animation-delay:.48s;}
  @keyframes bar{ 0%,100%{ transform:scaleY(0.4);} 50%{ transform:scaleY(1);} }
  .host-line{ font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size:12.5px; color:var(--white-faint); margin-top:28px; }
  .host-line b{ color:var(--white); font-weight:500; }

  /* ---------- ENFOQUE (split cards) ---------- */
  .approach-grid{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); border:1px solid var(--line); }
  @media (max-width:760px){ .approach-grid{ grid-template-columns:1fr; } }
  .approach-card{ padding:38px 30px; border-right:1px solid var(--line); }
  .approach-card:last-child{ border-right:none; }
  @media (max-width:760px){ .approach-card{ border-right:none; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); } .approach-card:last-child{ border-bottom:none; } }
  .approach-card.filled{ background:var(--green); }
  .approach-card .tag{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size:12px; color:var(--green);
    letter-spacing:.08em; text-transform:uppercase; margin-bottom:16px; display:block;
  }
  .approach-card.filled .tag{ color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75); }
  .approach-card h3{ font-family:'Anton', sans-serif; font-size:19px; text-transform:uppercase; margin-bottom:12px; letter-spacing:0.01em; line-height:1.15; }
  .approach-card p{ color:var(--white-dim); font-size:14.5px; }
  .approach-card.filled p{ color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85); }

  /* ---------- ACHALAY ---------- */
  .achalay{
    background: linear-gradient(150deg, var(--green) 0%, var(--green-deep) 55%, var(--green-dark) 100%);
    color:var(--white);
  }
  .achalay .eyebrow{ color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75); }
  .achalay .eyebrow::before{ background:var(--white); }
  .achalay-grid{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:56px; align-items:center; }
  @media (max-width:760px){ .achalay-grid{ grid-template-columns:1fr; } }
  .achalay h2{ font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,38px); margin:18px 0 20px; }
  .achalay p{ color:rgba(255,255,255,0.82); font-size:16px; margin-bottom:14px; max-width:52ch; }
  .achalay-stats{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:24px; }
  .stat{ border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.28); padding-top:14px; }
  .stat .n{ font-family:'Anton', sans-serif; font-size:36px; }
  .stat .l{ font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size:11px; letter-spacing:.05em; text-transform:uppercase; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.78); margin-top:4px; }

  /* ---------- FOOTER CTA ---------- */
  footer.cta-final{ text-align:center; padding:110px 0 90px; position:relative; overflow:hidden; }
  footer.cta-final h2{ font-size:clamp(32px,6vw,56px); margin-bottom:26px; }
  footer.cta-final h2 .foco{ color:var(--green); }
  footer.cta-final .lede{ color:var(--white-dim); font-size:17px; max-width:50ch; margin:0 auto 36px; }
  .foot-links{
    margin-top:80px; display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center;
    padding-top:26px; border-top:1px solid var(--line);
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size:12px; color:var(--white-faint);
    flex-wrap:wrap; gap:16px;
  }
  .foot-links .foot-legal{ display:flex; gap:24px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
  .foot-links .foot-legal a:hover{ color:var(--white); }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){ *{ animation:none !important; transition:none !important; } }  /* ---------- SCROLL TO TOP ---------- */
  .scroll-top-btn{
    position:fixed;
    bottom:28px; right:28px;
    width:48px; height:48px;
    border-radius:50%;
    background:var(--green);
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    box-shadow:0 10px 26px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);
    opacity:0; visibility:hidden; transform:translateY(12px);
    transition: opacity .3s ease, transform .3s ease, background .2s ease, visibility .3s;
    z-index:60;
    border:none; cursor:pointer;
  }
  .scroll-top-btn.visible{ opacity:1; visibility:visible; transform:translateY(0); }
  .scroll-top-btn:hover{ background:var(--green-deep); }
  .scroll-top-btn svg{ width:20px; height:20px; fill:var(--white); }

  /* ---------- SCROLL FADE-IN ---------- */
  .fade-in{
    opacity:0;
    transform:translateY(28px);
    transition: opacity .7s ease, transform .7s ease;
  }
  .fade-in.in-view{ opacity:1; transform:translateY(0); }
  .fade-in-stagger.in-view > *{ opacity:1; transform:translateY(0); }
  .fade-in-stagger > *{
    opacity:0;
    transform:translateY(20px);
    transition: opacity .6s ease, transform .6s ease;
  }
  .fade-in-stagger.in-view > *:nth-child(1){ transition-delay: .05s; }
  .fade-in-stagger.in-view > *:nth-child(2){ transition-delay: .15s; }
  .fade-in-stagger.in-view > *:nth-child(3){ transition-delay: .25s; }
  .fade-in-stagger.in-view > *:nth-child(4){ transition-delay: .35s; }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    .fade-in, .fade-in-stagger > *{ opacity:1 !important; transform:none !important; transition:none !important; }
  }

</style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="site">
  <div class="navbar">
    <div class="logo"><span>ABRIENDO EL</span><span class="foco">FOCO</span></div>
    <nav>
      <a href="#proyecto">Abriendo el Foco</a>
      <a href="#capitulos">Capítulos</a>
    </nav>
    <a class="studio-badge" href="#">Un proyecto de Testeha Estudio</a>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="hero" id="top">
  <div class="hero-glow"></div>
  <svg class="hero-arcs" viewBox="0 0 640 640" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
    <circle cx="500" cy="140" r="90" fill="none" stroke="#019946" stroke-width="1.2" opacity="0.5"/>
    <circle cx="500" cy="140" r="130" fill="none" stroke="#019946" stroke-width="1.2" opacity="0.35"/>
    <circle cx="500" cy="140" r="170" fill="none" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.15"/>
  </svg>
  <div class="wrap hero-grid">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Testeha Estudio × Asociación Achalay</p>
      <h1>Abriendo<br>el <span class="foco">Foco</span></h1>
      <p class="lede">Un podcast que acerca el tercer sector a la vida cotidiana: conversaciones cercanas sobre financiación, innovación social y los puentes entre empresa y causa social.</p>
      <div class="hero-ctas">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://open.spotify.com/show/6aXX0Kz5ptIOHHF8WQzSWd" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Escuchar en Spotify</a>
        <a class="text-link" href="#capitulos">Ver capítulos ↓</a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-trust-row">
      <div class="hero-trusted">
        <p class="eyebrow">Proyecto para</p>
        <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Asociación Achalay">
      </div>
      <div class="hero-thanks">
        <p class="eyebrow">Agradecimientos a</p>
        <div class="hero-thanks-logos">
          <img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="Havas Village">
          <div class="chip"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="Fundación Lealtad"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="phone-stage">
      <div class="phone">
        <div class="phone-notch"></div>
        <div class="phone-screen">
          <div class="phone-topbar"><span>9:41</span><span>●●●</span></div>
          <div class="phone-art"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Portada de Abriendo el Foco"></div>
          <p class="phone-title">Capítulo 2 · Innovación social</p>
          <p class="phone-sub">Abriendo el Foco — Achalay</p>
          <div class="phone-progress"></div>
          <div class="phone-time"><span>6:12</span><span>-11:03</span></div>
          <div class="phone-controls">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6 6h2v12H6zm3.5 6L18 6v12z"/></svg>
            <div class="play"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/></svg></div>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M16 6h2v12h-2zM6 6l8.5 6L6 18z"/></svg>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="phone-caption">— reproduciendo ahora —</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="proyecto">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head fade-in">
      <p class="eyebrow">El proyecto</p>
      <div>
        <h2>El tercer sector, contado por quienes lo viven</h2>
        <p class="lede">Abriendo el Foco nace para que temas que suelen quedarse dentro del sector social —financiación, transparencia, colaboración empresa-ONG— lleguen también a quien nunca ha pisado una asamblea de una entidad.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="about-grid fade-in">
      <div class="about-text">
        <p>Cada episodio reúne a una voz de Achalay con una persona experta externa, para poner en común lo que ocurre dentro del sector social con la mirada de quienes colaboran desde fuera: fundaciones, empresas y otras entidades.</p>
        <p>Con la conducción de Rocío Periago, el resultado es un formato breve —entre 15 y 20 minutos— pensado para escucharse sin que haga falta conocer el sector para seguir la conversación.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-quote">
        <blockquote>"Lo primero que hay que hacer es abrir el foco."</blockquote>
        <cite>— Ramón Pinna, presidente de Achalay, Capítulo 1</cite>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="capitulos">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head fade-in">
      <p class="eyebrow">Capítulos</p>
      <div>
        <h2>Tres conversaciones, tres puertas de entrada</h2>
        <p class="lede">Del tráiler a la innovación social: así se ha ido abriendo el foco, capítulo a capítulo.</p>
      </div>
